@startuml
actor "Cliente IA / RAG / LLM" as client

rectangle "MCP Server (Ej: MELIAN)" {
  [API MCP (REST/HTTP)]
  [Adapter SQL/FS/API/NoSQL/...]
  [Chunking y Enrichment]
  [Embedding Engine (opcional)]
  [Serializador MCP]
}

client --> [API MCP (REST/HTTP)] : Consulta (NLQ/SQL/Filter)
[API MCP (REST/HTTP)] --> [Adapter SQL/FS/API/NoSQL/...]
[Adapter SQL/FS/API/NoSQL/...] --> [Chunking y Enrichment]
[Chunking y Enrichment] --> [Embedding Engine (opcional)]
[Embedding Engine (opcional)] --> [Serializador MCP]
[Serializador MCP] --> client : Respuesta MCP (chunks + metadata + embedding)
@enduml
